  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6104.02 Home Study Course and Self-Test. Home study courses and self-tests shall meet the course content requirements as set forth in Saf-C 6103.02(f).\n\nSource. #7650, eff 2-20-02; ss by #9472, eff 5-18-09; ss by #12467, eff 1-25-18",
